{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_17","type":"agent_message","text":"The core shape is settled: a warm paper-like editorial shop, a deliberately simple two-variant tee configurator, and one clean purchase action. I’m adding a sandbox-friendly fallback only for the missing Stripe account credential; when the Stripe secret is present, the exact same action creates a real hosted Checkout session, and the webhook turns paid sessions into Prodigi sandbox orders."}}
